[
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:06.160",
        "end_time": "00:00:14.160",
        "text": "Arl, let us discuss things as we used to, in a civilized manner. Fair words,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:12.400",
        "end_time": "00:00:21.119",
        "text": "Carlile, but a little out of place given the battalion you've assembled against us. I"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:19.199",
        "end_time": "00:00:28.880",
        "text": "can promise you that was never my intent. No laws have been broken. We see"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:25.039",
        "end_time": "00:00:32.760",
        "text": "the child. Do not treat us as fools. She is not an immortal."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:33.200",
        "end_time": "00:00:39.200",
        "text": "These witnesses can attest to that."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:36.880",
        "end_time": "00:00:44.160",
        "text": "You can look see the flush of human blood in her"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:40.800",
        "end_time": "00:00:51.680",
        "text": "cheeks. Artifist. I will collect every facet of the truth, but from someone"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:48.079",
        "end_time": "00:00:53.360",
        "text": "more central to the story."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:51.680",
        "end_time": "00:01:03.559",
        "text": "Edward, as the child clings to your newborn mate, I assume you are involved."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:15.360",
        "end_time": "00:02:19.319",
        "text": "I'd like to meet her."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:10.560",
        "end_time": "00:03:21.159",
        "text": "Ah, Young Well, immortality becomes you."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:27.040",
        "end_time": "00:03:31.959",
        "text": "I hear her strange heart."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:50.640",
        "end_time": "00:03:53.280",
        "text": "Hello Aru."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:10.239",
        "end_time": "00:04:13.239",
        "text": "Magnific"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:17.680",
        "end_time": "00:04:28.080",
        "text": "half mortal, half immortal. mortal conceived and carried by this"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:26.320",
        "end_time": "00:04:38.520",
        "text": "newborn while she was still human. Impossible."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:33.840",
        "end_time": "00:04:38.520",
        "text": "Do you think they fooled me, brother?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:44.720",
        "end_time": "00:04:48.840",
        "text": "Bring the Informer forward."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:00.639",
        "end_time": "00:05:07.320",
        "text": "Is that the child you saw?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:08.160",
        "end_time": "00:05:18.479",
        "text": "I'm not sure. Jane, she's changed. This child is bigger. Then your allegations"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:15.120",
        "end_time": "00:05:20.639",
        "text": "were false. The Cullins are innocent."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:18.479",
        "end_time": "00:05:23.639",
        "text": "I take full responsibility for my mistake."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:32.479",
        "end_time": "00:05:38.759",
        "text": "Guy is no."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:35.199",
        "end_time": "00:05:38.759",
        "text": "I ran out."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:49.680",
        "end_time": "00:05:52.680",
        "text": "Blime,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:57.199",
        "end_time": "00:06:04.160",
        "text": "give me my sight back. Tanya, this is what they want. If you attack now, we'll"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:01.199",
        "end_time": "00:06:07.399",
        "text": "all die."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:24.560",
        "end_time": "00:06:27.560",
        "text": "pain."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:01.680",
        "end_time": "00:07:06.759",
        "text": "It's working."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:03.759",
        "end_time": "00:07:06.759",
        "text": "Heat. Heat."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:36.080",
        "end_time": "00:07:42.080",
        "text": "Aro, you see there's no law broken here."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:39.360",
        "end_time": "00:07:45.680",
        "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:42.080",
        "end_time": "00:07:48.680",
        "text": "But does it then follow that there is no danger?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:50.800",
        "end_time": "00:08:04.560",
        "text": "For the first time in our history, humans pose a threat to our kind. Their"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:01.360",
        "end_time": "00:08:09.560",
        "text": "modern technology has given birth to weapons that could destroy us."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:09.599",
        "end_time": "00:08:16.759",
        "text": "Maintaining our secret has never been more imperative."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:17.039",
        "end_time": "00:08:32.000",
        "text": "In such perilous times, only the known is safe."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:27.120",
        "end_time": "00:08:43.560",
        "text": "Only the known is tolerable. And we know nothing of what this child will become."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:38.159",
        "end_time": "00:08:43.560",
        "text": "Can we live with such uncertainty?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:08:44.640",
        "end_time": "00:08:55.080",
        "text": "Spare ourselves a fight today only to die tomorrow."
    }
]